{"title":"Solar Engineer Roadmap","role":"Solar Engineer","summary":"A Solar Engineer designs, evaluates, installs, commissions, monitors, and improves solar photovoltaic (PV) systems.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Energy / Renewable Energy Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Solar Engineer designs, evaluates, installs, commissions, monitors, and improves solar photovoltaic (PV) systems."},{"type":"p","text":"The career combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar PV technology"},{"text":"Electrical engineering"},{"text":"Power systems"},{"text":"Energy modelling"},{"text":"Project engineering"},{"text":"System design"},{"text":"Construction & commissioning"},{"text":"Operations & maintenance"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Energy economics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Solar engineers can work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Residential rooftop systems"},{"text":"Commercial & industrial (C&I) solar"},{"text":"Utility-scale solar farms"},{"text":"Solar-plus-storage systems"},{"text":"Microgrids"},{"text":"Solar EPC projects"},{"text":"Solar manufacturing"},{"text":"Energy consulting"},{"text":"Renewable-energy development"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong modern profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Solar PV Engineering","Electrical Systems","Energy Analytics","Storage","Digital Tools"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Solar Engineer can specialize in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar PV Design"},{"text":"Solar Project Engineering"},{"text":"Solar EPC"},{"text":"Solar O&M"},{"text":"Solar Plant Performance"},{"text":"Solar Resource Assessment"},{"text":"Energy Modelling"},{"text":"Solar + Battery Storage"},{"text":"Microgrids"},{"text":"Grid Integration"},{"text":"Renewable Energy Consulting"},{"text":"Solar Project Development"},{"text":"Renewable Energy Asset Mana