"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Solar PV","Inverter","Battery / Grid / Load","Energy Management System"]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates opportunities beyond traditional PV design."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Professional Development","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful learning areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar PV Design"},{"text":"PVsyst"},{"text":"Renewable Energy Systems"},{"text":"Energy Management"},{"text":"Energy Auditing"},{"text":"Electrical Safety"},{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on career direction, students can also explore recognized professional programs in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar PV installation/design"},{"text":"Energy management"},{"text":"Energy auditing"},{"text":"Occupational safety"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Certifications should be selected based on the target job rather than collecting many unrelated certificates."}]}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"M.Tech / M.E."},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant specializations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Renewable Energy Engineering"},{"text":"Energy Engineering"},{"text":"Solar Energy"},{"text":"Power Systems"},{"text":"Electrical Engineering"},{"text":"Energy Systems"},{"text":"Sustainable Energy"},{"text":"Energy Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for moving toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Renewable Energy Management"},{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Energy Business"},{"text":"Infrastructure Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Master's Abroad"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Renewable Energy"},{"text":"Sustainable Energy Systems"},{"text":"Energy Engineering"},{"text":"Power Systems"},{"text":"Energy Economics"},{"text":"Energy & Environmental 